my called the Automatons emerges with the goal of destroying humanity. Players serve as Helldivers, elite shock troops deployed from orbit to reclaim lost territory and repel both threats in an ongoing galactic conflict shaped by the collective actions of all players.", "summary": "Helldivers 2 is a cooperative third-person shooter in which squads of up to four players are deployed from orbit onto hostile planets to complete strategic missions. Players select loadouts of weapons, armor, and stratagems that allow them to call in orbital strikes, supply drops, vehicles, and turrets during combat. Friendly fire is always active, requiring coordination between teammates. The game features a persistent galactic war where community-wide performance determines which planets are liberated or lost.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/helldivers-2", "videos": [{"id": 90300, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "rE7KTE28HrA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rE7KTE28HrA", "title": "Helldivers 2 - Announce Trailer | PS5 & PC Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rE7KTE28HrA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 103116, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "00vttMQgFWA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00vttMQgFWA", "title": "Helldivers 2 - Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/00vttMQgFWA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 93260, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "sqCxyt5QRSg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sqCxyt5QRSg", "title": "Helldivers 2 - Co-op and Combat Trailer | PS5 & PC Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sqCxyt5QRSg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 97939, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "lUaaT_k9Nv8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lUaaT_k9Nv8", "title": "Helldivers 2 - Bile Titan Liberation Gameplay | PS5 & PC Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lUaaT_k9Nv8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 105582, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "22rg3b